  "keyFeatures": [
    "Dual-engine security auditing with OpenSCAP (CIS Level 2) and Lynis",
    "Three-phase Measure, Harden, Re-Measure pipeline",
    "Before and after comparative security scorecards",
    "Automated OS hardening via ansible-hardening and dev-sec.ssh-hardening",
    "Package integrity verification with debsums",
    "Multi-platform support: Ubuntu, Debian, RHEL, CentOS, Rocky Linux, AlmaLinux",
    "Pre-remediation safety checks to prevent SSH lockout and boot failure",
    "Unprivileged sandbox and mock execution mode",
    "OpenSCAP remediation script generation for administrator review",
    "Ubuntu USN OVAL vulnerability assessment"
  ],
